<title>USA: A.M. Best affirms Provident, Revere rating.</title>
<headline>A.M. Best affirms Provident, Revere rating.</headline>
<dateline>OLDWICK, N.J. 1997-03-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>A.M. Best said it has removed from review and affirmed the &quot;A&quot; ratings of Provident Cos Inc's Provident Life &amp; Accident Insurance Co and Paul Revere Life Insurance Co.</p>
<p>On Thursday, Provident completed its acquisition of Paul Revere.</p>
